1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:12,090
2 ways to check prices at Talented Education Group: in the app, or in your browser via the link below this video.

2
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:25,680
Way 1: the Talented app – free, no Play Store or App Store needed.

3
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:34,520
Open the price list on your phone and tap "Pasang Aplikasi Talented" (Install the Talented app) below the tutorial video.

4
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:52,910
Android: in Chrome tap Install, or use the three-dot menu → "Install app" / "Add to Home screen".

5
00:00:53,510 --> 00:01:07,050
iPhone/iPad: in Safari tap Share → "Add to Home Screen" → "Add".

6
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:18,810
Done! The Talented icon is now on your home screen.

7
00:01:19,410 --> 00:01:32,850
Way 2: your browser – click the link below this video.

8
00:01:33,450 --> 00:01:51,930
Open the price list page and pick your language at the top right – 15 languages. Below: verified-agent badges, then this tutorial video.

9
00:01:52,530 --> 00:02:15,090
The menu: programmes, English, pathways, other schools, IELTS/PTE/Korean/Japanese classes, scholarships, jobs, accommodation and start your application – plus FREE Mock Test and free consultation buttons.

10
00:02:15,690 --> 00:02:38,880
Sponsored banners show the latest promos and scholarships from partner schools. Use the numbers or arrows, then click the button to see that school's programmes and costs. Ads never change prices or sorting.

11
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:50,720
Talented event videos: info sessions, seminars and school expos – click to watch.

12
00:02:51,320 --> 00:03:09,280
Choose your country – Australia, New Zealand and many more – then Offshore (still in Indonesia) or Onshore (already there).

13
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:19,100
Search by course or school, then filter by city, field and level.

14
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:39,360
Enter your IELTS or PTE overall score: each card shows whether it meets the listed minimum. You can also filter for programmes with automatic scholarships.

15
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:48,000
Pick your OSHC provider – insurance costs are recalculated for every result.

16
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:59,430
Sort by cheapest, upfront cost, total study cost, recommended bank balance, A–Z or duration.

17
00:04:00,030 --> 00:04:10,830
Each card shows upfront cost, total study cost and recommended bank balance, with an IDR estimate.

18
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:31,880
Green badge = scholarship (e.g. automatic 30%); yellow badge = Special discount Talented from the 2nd payment. The card says whether prices are before or after the scholarship.

19
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:43,140
Open Programme details to see tuition per period, material and enrolment fees, and the upfront periods.

20
00:04:43,740 --> 00:04:55,700
Upfront cost, minimum bank balance for the visa, and a refund policy summary with its official source.

21
00:04:56,300 --> 00:05:10,900
Tick “Add estimated living costs” to include living costs for the whole study period in the total.

22
00:05:11,500 --> 00:05:33,660
Bringing family: tick partner, enter the number of children and answer the school-age question. Visa, OSHC and recommended balance are calculated; a warning shows the right policy type.

23
00:05:34,260 --> 00:05:47,490
In the details, the visa fee is shown per person, plus the Professional Admin fee and the Professional Admin fee per dependant – all added to the upfront cost.

24
00:05:48,090 --> 00:05:59,520
Download a PDF or send it to WhatsApp; Start your application and Ask a consultant are on every card.

25
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:13,780
The PDF downloads straight away – every page has the Talented logo, a document code, date, QR code and watermark.

26
00:06:14,380 --> 00:06:34,999
Catalogue PDF links from your consultant open in your chosen language. When it says ready, click Save PDF / ZIP; if it fails or the link is incomplete, a message and a Try again button appear.

27
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:49,810
Tick Select on the programmes you like (up to 10), then click Compare – and download the comparison as a PDF.

28
00:06:50,410 --> 00:07:06,210
Your selected programmes appear in the bottom bar: download them as a PDF (comparison table and/or full details) or send the PDF to WhatsApp.

29
00:07:06,810 --> 00:07:22,580
English (ELICOS): weekly fees with a simulation based on each school's base weeks – upfront cost, total cost and recommended balance.

30
00:07:23,180 --> 00:07:41,230
Pathway packages: VET at one school, then a Bachelor at another, with upfront cost, total and recommended balance.

31
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:55,710
Other schools: the official CRICOS directory – 1,539 schools with courses and indicative prices.

32
00:07:56,310 --> 00:08:09,990
IELTS/PTE preparation with Victory Scholars Academy – TEG is a Pearson PTE Elite Partner 2026.

33
00:08:10,590 --> 00:08:22,210
Basic English, PTE Foundation, IELTS/PTE Preparation, Japanese and Korean – online and offline, priced in IDR.

34
00:08:22,810 --> 00:08:44,490
Scholarships: active scholarships for Indonesian students – filter by country, level, provider and funding, or TEG partner campuses. Always check the official source.

35
00:08:45,090 --> 00:08:59,760
Job listings updated automatically twice a day. Never pay to get a job.

36
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:20,500
Accommodation: student housing providers with price ranges. Never transfer money before an official contract.

37
00:09:21,100 --> 00:09:30,820
Start your application: document checklist, process steps and a student visa process video.

38
00:09:31,420 --> 00:09:45,320
Our offices in Sydney, Pontianak and Singkawang, and the Student Information Form (PDF/Excel).

39
00:09:45,920 --> 00:10:10,310
Prices are estimates. Official partners in Indonesia: PT. Pilar Pendidikan Internasional & PT. Bintang Samudra Ternama.
